          "text": "Bromothymol blue &#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2350;&#2379;&#2341;&#2366;&#2311;&#2350;&#2377;&#2354; &#2344;&#2368;&#2354;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Bromothymol blue</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2350;&#2379;&#2341;&#2366;&#2311;&#2350;&#2377;&#2354; &#2344;&#2368;&#2354;&#2366;</span>"
