      "question": "The Ph of a neutral solution is _____ . &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2360;&#2368;&#2344; &#2357;&#2367;&#2354;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; Ph &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; _____ &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The Ph of a neutral solution is _____ .</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2360;&#2368;&#2344; &#2357;&#2367;&#2354;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; Ph &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; _____ &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "7 7",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "0 0",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "8 8",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "14 14",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">14</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">14</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>A <b>pH of 7</b> indicates a neutral solution, a pH greater than 7 indicates a basic solution, and a pH of less than 7 indicates an acidic solution.</p>",
